      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels deeper than just a \"difficult time\" though. it's more like the light has been permanently turned off. i look at my old work and it feels like someone else did it. like i'm just a hollow vessel that's been drained. there's no point in trying to \"move through\" it when there's nothing left to move with. it just feels... heavy. like the emptiness is the only true thing about me now.",
